            <ArticleTitle>Exercise echocardiography with addition of atropine.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>346-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Exercise echocardiography with the addition of atropine was performed in 31 patients who had a very small probability of achieving submaximal heart rate. Conclusive tests were obtained in 77% of the patients with this protocol.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
